      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it's just so stressful thinking i might have something serious when i'm already feeling so exhausted. honestly i just want to feel normal again. if i just take some high dose magnesium or maybe some electrolyte supplements and extra rest for a week, do you think that would help settle my heart rate? i really just want to fix this myself so i can stop worrying about it.",
